  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: Suriname &#x2013; Incubation training programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Suriname struggles with youth unemployment, lack of diversification of the economy, a poor investment climate and a low survival rates of startups.This project aims to contribute to a solution for these issues through providing the incubator Back Lot,&#xA0;with the necessary technical assistance to support their incubation programme.Through this project the creative sector in Suriname will be supported, the skills of young entrepreneurs will be developed and the team at the Back Lot will be supported in developing their incubation programme and training offerings.</narrative>
  </description>
